      "description": "Labeled toggle with an explanatory caption (e.g. Portland detour).",
      "html": "<label class=\"ds-switch-row\"><input type=\"checkbox\" checked><span class=\"ds-switch\"></span><span><b>Portland detour</b><small>Columbia Gorge and I-5 instead of Snoqualmie.</small></span></label>",
      "css": ".ds-switch-row{display:grid;grid-template-columns:auto 1fr;gap:10px;align-items:start;cursor:pointer;font-family:ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif;color:#18212b;width:320px}.ds-switch-row input{position:absolute;opacity:0;pointer-events:none}.ds-switch{width:34px;height:20px;border-radius:99px;background:#cfd5d0;position:relative;transition:background .15s;margin-top:1px}.ds-switch::after{content:'';position:absolute;top:2px;left:2px;width:16px;height:16px;border-radius:50%;background:#fff;box-shadow:0 1px 2px rgba(0,0,0,.25);transition:transform .15s}.ds-switch-row input:checked+.ds-switch{background:#0f766e}.ds-switch-row input:checked+.ds-switch::after{transform:translateX(14px)}.ds-switch-row input:focus-visible+.ds-switch{outline:2px solid #0f766e;outline-offset:2px}.ds-switch-row b{display:block;font-size:13.5px}.ds-switch-row small{display:block;color:#7b8692;font-size:12px;line-height:1.35}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Layer Toggle",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "layer-toggle",
      "description": "Icon-over-label pressed/unpressed tile for map weather layers.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-layers\"><button class=\"ds-layer\" aria-pressed=\"true\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 26 22\"><g transform=\"translate(13 11) rotate(60)\"><line x1=\"0\" y1=\"8\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"-4\" stroke=\"#ea580c\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\"/><path d=\"M0 -10 L-5 -2 L5 -2 Z\" fill=\"#ea580c\"/></g></svg>Wind</button><button class=\"ds-layer\" aria-pressed=\"false\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 26 22\"><rect x=\"1\" y=\"4\" width=\"24\" height=\"14\" rx=\"7\" fill=\"#3b82f6\"/><text x=\"13\" y=\"14.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" font-size=\"9\" font-weight=\"700\" fill=\"#fff\">31°</text></svg>Temp</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-layers{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,80px);gap:6px;font-family:ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif}.ds-layer{border:1px solid #e2e5e1;border-radius:9px;background:#fff;padding:8px 4px 6px;display:grid;justify-items:center;gap:3px;cursor:pointer;font-size:12px;color:#4a5662;font-family:inherit}.ds-layer svg{width:26px;height:22px}.ds-layer[aria-pressed=true]{border-color:#9fb3ad;background:#f4f8f6;color:#18212b}.ds-layer[aria-pressed=false]{color:#7b8692}.ds-layer[aria-pressed=false] svg{opacity:.3}.ds-layer:hover{border-color:#cfd4cf}.ds-layer:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #0f766e;outline-offset:2px}"
    },
