      "description": "30px square hairline button for show/hide.",
      "html": "<button class=\"ds-eye\" aria-label=\"Hide route\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\"><path d=\"M2 12s3.6-7 10-7 10 7 10 7-3.6 7-10 7S2 12 2 12z\"/><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"12\" r=\"3\"/></svg></button>",
      "css": ".ds-eye{border:1px solid #e2e5e1;background:#fff;border-radius:8px;width:30px;height:30px;display:grid;place-items:center;cursor:pointer;color:#4a5662;padding:0}.ds-eye:hover{background:#eef0ec}.ds-eye:focus-visible{outline:2px solid #0f766e;outline-offset:2px}.ds-eye svg{width:16px;height:16px}"
    },
