      "description": "Dark floating tooltip for the profile chart.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-tip\"><b>Elk Mountain · Sat 3:52 PM</b>28°F · wind 31 mph <span class=\"muted\">gust 47</span><br><span class=\"s\">snow 0.4 cm</span> · <span class=\"r\">rain 0 mm</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-tip{background:#111827;color:#f8fafc;border-radius:8px;padding:7px 9px;font:12px/1.4 ui-sans-serif,-apple-system,'Segoe UI',Roboto,sans-serif;box-shadow:0 4px 14px rgba(0,0,0,.2);max-width:260px;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-tip b{display:block;font-size:12.5px}.ds-tip .muted{color:#a5b0bd}.ds-tip .r{color:#93c5fd}.ds-tip .s{color:#c4b5fd}"
    }
